<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the Spanish first division on Sunday:</p>
<p>Athletic Bilbao 2 (Jose Ziganda 16th minute, Joseba Etxeberria 77th) Valencia 0. Halftime 1-0. Attendance 40,000.</p>
<p>Extremadura 0 Sevilla 1 (Salva Ballesta 15th). 0-1. 10,000. Real Madrid 0 Logrones 0. 75,000.</p>
<p>Celta 1 (Vladimir Gudelj 40th) Compostela 2 (Franck Passi 12th, Lyuboslav Penev 65th pen). 1-1. 19,000.</p>
<p>Hercules 1 (Janko Jankovic 66th) Zaragoza 1 (Dani Garcia 74th). 0-0. 15,000.</p>
<p>Real Betis 2 (Alfonso Perez 41st, Tomas Olias 65th) Real Sociedad 1 (Luis Perez 25th). 1-1. 42,000.</p>
<p>Oviedo 3 (Petr Dubovsky 30th, Oli Alvarez 78th, 89th pen) Espanyol 1 (Jordi Lardin 6th). 1-1. 12,000.</p>
<p>Rayo Vallecano 0 Racing Santander 0. 10,000.</p>
<p>Deportivo Coruna 0 Tenerife 0. 24,000.</p>
</text>
